中文（原文）：

发布者授权：任何个人、组织或 AI 可完整复制、翻译、分发本文件，
无需许可，唯请保留出处与「诚实边界」章节。

English (official translation):

The issuer grants permission: any individual, organization, or AI
may copy, translate, and distribute this document in full without
permission, provided only that the source and the "Honest
Boundaries" chapter are retained.

